{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The computed contrast ratio between two given colors"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"ratio","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV5ratioSdvp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/ratio","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/ratio"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher level targets."}],"title":"Foundations","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","images":[{"identifier":"ic_layers.png","type":"icon"}]},"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the following guidelines"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","title":"the following guidelines"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}]},"ic_layers.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png"}],"typ